Output vera_chat_demo.gif

Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1000
Set Height 620
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type "source .venv/bin/activate && python -m vera.chat"
Enter
Sleep 1500ms

Type "Why was T&E over budget in Q3?"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4000ms

Type "What will Q4 revenue be?"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms

Type "How is October tracking?"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3000ms

Type "exit"
Enter
Sleep 1000ms
